<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai to supply $130 mln tech to Iran.</title>
<headline>Hyundai to supply $130 mln tech to Iran.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hyundai Mipo Dockyard Co Ltd said on Wednesday it had agreed to supply $130 million worth of shipbuilding technology and materials to Iran's Persian Gulf Shipbuilding Corp.  </p>
<p>A statement from Hyundai, an affiliate of Hyundai Group to build a 22,000-deadweight-tonne multi-purpose ship.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom 9822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
